1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,580
(Bernadette:)Excuse me, I have to pee.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,030
(Bernadette:)Or is that
implausible, as well?!

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,640
(Howard:)It's nice to have another
couple to hang with, isn't it?

4
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,880
(Penny(to the shoes):)All right, guys,
you have to go back.

5
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,200
(Penny(to the shoes):)I can't afford you.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,580
(Penny(to the shoes):)No, don't send
us away; we love you.

7
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:27,250
I love you, too,
but you cost more than my rent.

8
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,260
But, Penny,
you look so good in us.

9
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,640
Damn it, the shoes are right.

10
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:37,060
(Amy:)Good golly, Penny,
your whimsy is boundless.

11
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:43,100
(Amy:)What do you got for me,
wildebeest?

12
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,140
(Bernadette(in Raj's bathroom):)I think they're on to me.

13
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,410
(Bernadette(in Raj's bathroom):)The story's starting
to fall apart.

14
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,410
(Amy:)Calm down.
Everything's going to be okay.

15
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:50,680
(Amy:)We may have
to kill her.

16
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,910
(Amy:)Bernadette, I'm putting
you on speakerphone.

17
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,850
(Amy:)Where are you now?

18
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:57,220
(Bernadette:)In the bathroom.

19
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,950
(Amy:)Oh, look at this, another one of
our classic bathroom gabfests.

